<item><title>Seychelles opposition leader Bernard Georges calls 2027 budget a small-change plan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sc/seychelles-opposition-leader-bernard-georges-calls-2027-7089c8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sc/seychelles-opposition-leader-bernard-georges-calls-2027-7089c8/</guid><category>Seychelles</category><description>Georges said the budget made no major announcements and was a small-change plan, cutting into the spending response the government had promised.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:07:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sc/seychelles-opposition-leader-bernard-georges-calls-2027-7089c8/share.jpg" length="44871" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sc/seychelles-opposition-leader-bernard-georges-calls-2027-7089c8/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
